{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1000_p", "source_sha256": "50dc627e9d00a6e516968c01043a1d545d78933abda32f915081da1858227acf", "ja": "（やよいが『宇宙』をテーマにした撮影を終え、\n今から帰るところなのだが……）", "zh": "（やよい结束了以“宇宙”为主题的拍摄，现在正准备回去，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "108c1184768df7db4b6d2d7130bb52a1c02620145b870e9c6bf6abc928cbb0d7", "ja": "……はわっ、あの光はもしかして！？\n……と思ったけど、うーん、やっぱりただの星かなぁ。", "zh": "……哇哇，那道光该不会是！？\n……虽然这么想，唔——好像还是普通星星呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2f0e41e44d6f29527dad83a3fef3088e5db632ccd6bf82d46a74e65779ecd930", "ja": "なにか探しているのか？　流れ星とか。", "zh": "你在找什么吗？流星之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "9a97ee362c2fd51e0d7b8de347e9d4d70068aa70e0c176b5b8a08a65fec3c54a", "ja": "あっ、えへへ……。宇宙人がいないかな～って、\n思って探してたんですー！", "zh": "啊，嘿嘿……我在想会不会有外星人～所以就找起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1004_p", "source_sha256": "eae385331c9b406a75885efa38ed95a7995d7dce1797dd1fdea1a69b537a9a84", "ja": "宇宙人？　もしかして、さっきの撮影の影響かな。\nUFOのセットにも、宇宙人が乗ってたし。", "zh": "外星人？难道是受了刚才拍摄的影响吗？\n毕竟UFO的布景里，也坐着外星人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "35bd8930149641c373d1c484c83dbcdfba5ce0870ab029280aaca2fd80fc9cde", "ja": "そうなんですー。\nよーく探したら、ほんとに見つからないかなーって。", "zh": "就是这样啦——\n我想，要是仔细找找，说不定真的能找到呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9fcdd99bdd62901a71a9696760a7de300df58d00eae0cde03c72d2b454e2e559", "ja": "はは、そうか。ずいぶん熱心だったけど……\n宇宙人と会ってみたいのか？", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。你还真是热心……  \n你想见见外星人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "577547fdfa059db46d63597c73354e2943c20d531791afc059f1110a4f23000e", "ja": "はい！　会って、お友達になれたらいいな～って！\nだって、すっごく楽しそうじゃないですか！", "zh": "是的！要是能见面并和他们成为朋友就好了～！\n因为，感觉一定会特别有意思吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "3e75b9082b7585e2ac52d3078d1202ad64afd5bb589c03534fa50988b037814a", "ja": "宇宙のお野菜とか、お肉とか……私の知らない\nことを、たーっくさん知ってると思いますし！", "zh": "宇宙里的蔬菜呀、肉类呀……我觉得他们肯定\n知道超～多我不知道的事情呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "18e037a1c5c033db52dd7f5277417ff9857dc10f747ae57d09eae46f245403f3", "ja": "あ、あとあと、節約レシピとか、\nそういう情報交換もしてみたいんです！", "zh": "啊，还有还有，我也想和您交流节约食谱之类的信息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7d6af4ea56e1026a6be3dc642d74d2d99cf6070083d0f81afb5711a6848b038a", "ja": "宇宙人と節約レシピの交換……。\n確かに、新しい発見が多そうだな。", "zh": "和外星人交换省钱食谱……\n确实，感觉会有很多新发现啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "5f0a63159deed5221607719707301c570acad156917d3fea1109fc83156cb0b1", "ja": "ですよね！　それに遠い星で、私と同じ、\nアイドルをしてる宇宙人とかもいるかもしれませんし！", "zh": "对吧！而且，说不定在遥远的星球上，也有和我一样当偶像的外星人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "fe9fd73a2213b1ef42d5a76623ac498f36717b8f6ad362075623a4dadf3b604e", "ja": "地球のアイドルとコラボするために来た、みたいな。\nえへへ、考えるだけでワクワクしちゃいますね♪", "zh": "比如“为了和地球的偶像合作才来到这里”这样。\n嘿嘿，光是想想就让人好兴奋呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c4f91961dc002ae28af0ce2a20933850c9dafbc05829fde2c9c60b447747acec", "ja": "おお、壮大だな。宇宙アイドルとコラボ……\n実現したら、すごいことになりそうだ。", "zh": "哦，真是宏大啊。和宇宙偶像合作……\n要是能实现，感觉会变得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "b6e2ed059b655c70a3b4cd3ef2c4a3b95c50e06bc108d0237144f8f706954bf9", "ja": "うっうー！　{$P$}、\nその時は絶対、私も出演させてくださいね！", "zh": "呜呜——！{$P$}，到那时候请一定也让我出演哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1015_p", "source_sha256": "39897f1ea992c70fc2990825a4741ba003fcdf914cfcbe025b8aa90140fada5a", "ja": "はは。そうだな。よし、その時は、\nやよいにセンターをお任せするとしようか！", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。好，那到时候就把C位交给弥生吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0473_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "4dc3d70147c15ea1e42bc0f9e74aa5a361ca05798a8f1efb361c24822e4fa28d", "ja": "ありがとうございますーっ！\nそんな日が、本当に来てくれたら嬉しいなぁ……♪", "zh": "太谢谢您了——！\n要是真的能有那么一天，我一定会超开心的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
